---
title: "School of Health Professions"
order: 9
---

The School of Health Professions includes Associate of Science (AS) and Associate of Applied Science (AAS) degrees that are intended for transfer and/or entrance into related career field. Additionally, the School of Health Professions offers certain Certificate (C) and Career Studies Certificates (CSC) to provide student access to specialized curriculum designed to support specific scientific and healthcare related educational pursuits.

